 "mapping": {
  "author": "claude-mapper-fdn-m5",
  "date": "2026-11-17",
  "draft_py": "# FDN Crossway Troublemakers: \"Attacking Vampires you control have deathtouch and lifelink.\n# Whenever a Vampire you control dies, you may pay 2 life. If you do, draw a card.\"\n# [0]: one static of two grants (FDN Unflinching Courage's Seq of GRANT_ABILITY in a static, sorted\n# by name: D23) over M21 Warded Battlements' \"attacking creatures you control\" narrowed to Vampires\n# (Pack Leader's tribal SUBTYPE_EQ + TYPE_EQ Creature).\n# [1]: a CreatureDiesEvent over Vampires you control (Troublemakers is one, so its own death counts,\n# CR 603.10a); effect: M21 Ghostly Pilferer's verified \"you may pay {2}. If you do, draw a card.\"\n# with the cost a life payment (CostLife 2, Tavern Swindler's \"Pay 3 life\" part).\nattacking_vampires = Selector(\n    count=QUnbounded(),\n    mode=SelectorMode.ALL,\n    filter=FAnd(\n        children=(\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU),\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.IS_ATTACKING),\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.SUBTYPE_EQ, string_value='Vampire'),\n            FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n        ),\n    ),\n    zones=(Zone(kind=ZoneKind.BATTLEFIELD, controller=ControllerRef.ANY),),\n)\ngrants = StaticAbility(\n    effect=Seq(\n        steps=(\n            A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {\n                'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.DEATHTOUCH),\n                'target': attacking_vampires,\n            }),\n            A(Verb.GRANT_ABILITY, {\n                'ability': KeywordAbility(keyword=Keyword.LIFELINK),\n                'target': attacking_vampires,\n            }),\n        ),\n    ),\n)\nvampire_dies = TriggeredAbility(\n    event=CreatureDiesEvent(\n        filter=FAnd(\n            children=(\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.CONTROLLER_IS, who=ControllerRef.YOU),\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.SUBTYPE_EQ, string_value='Vampire'),\n                FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.TYPE_EQ, string_value='Creature'),\n            ),\n        ),\n    ),\n    condition=None,\n    effect=Seq(\n        steps=(\n            OptionalEffect(\n                inner=A(Verb.PAY, {'cost': Cost(parts=(CostLife(amount=QConst(value=2)),))}),\n            ),\n            Conditional(\n                pred=FAtom(pred=FAtomPred.MAY_DONE),\n                then_effect=A(Verb.DRAW, {'amount': QConst(value=1), 'controller': ControllerRef.YOU}),\n            ),\n        ),\n    ),\n)\nabilities = [grants, vampire_dies, *compiled]\n",
  "clauses": [
   {
    "clause": "Attacking Vampires you control have deathtouch and lifelink.",
    "ir": "abilities[0]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "Whenever a Vampire you control dies, you may pay 2 life.",
    "ir": "abilities[1]"
   },
   {
    "clause": "If you do, draw a card.",
    "ir": "abilities[1].effect.steps[1]"
   }
  ],
  "g0_warnings": [],
  "notes": "One static of two grants (Unflinching Courage's Seq of GRANT_ABILITY, sorted: D23) over Warded Battlements' attacking creatures you control narrowed to Vampires; a CreatureDiesEvent over Vampires you control (its own death included) with Ghostly Pilferer's 'you may pay ... If you do, draw a card' paying CostLife 2. packs in tools/scenarios/mapped/FDN/: crossway_troublemakers_attacking_vampires_deathtouch_and_lifelink, crossway_troublemakers_blocking_vampire_no_lifelink_may_decline."
